  {
   "id": 50,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
    -1300,
    1200
   ],
   "size": [
    700,
    760
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 50,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "## H3MD 多人换人：关键帧 + 计划包（H3MD 0.5.5）\n\n**做什么**：一次运行把原片里要换的人在几个时刻画成新角色（关键帧），再写好 Remake 计划，打成计划包 zip。之后到导演台出片：打开 `H3MD Director Remake.json` →「导入计划」选这个 zip → 运行。\n\n**怎么用**\n1. 把原片拖进左上角的「Source video 原片」（加载视频）节点。只想换其中一段，就在 Prepare 填 `start_s`（起始秒）和 `end_s`（结束秒，0 = 到片尾），这一段连同原声截出来当原片用。横屏出 1664×960，竖屏出 960×1664（居中裁）。\n2. 角色图接到 picture_1…5。\n3. `mapping` 写\"图1换左二\"：人按**开头第一帧清楚的画面从左到右**编号，先跑一次看「认人表」核对编号。\n4. `descriptions` 每张图一行：人种、年龄、长相、发型、每件衣服（建议英文，会写进 Remake 提示词）。`people_at_start` 可选：原片开头从左到右每人一行现在的样子，帮修图认准人。\n5. 运行。看「关键帧总览」，满意就去导演台导入 `output/H3MD_plans/<名字>.zip`；不满意换修图种子再跑。\n\n**修图模型可以换**：中间这组是示例（Qwen Image 2.1 编辑 + 2 步 LoRA + 官方提示词增强）。换成任何\"图1 + 图2 + 提示词 → 新图\"的编辑模型都行：输入接 Prepare 的 crops（图1）、pictures（图2）、prompts，输出接 Assemble 的 edited。提示词增强可以旁路（直接用 Prepare 写好的提示词）。\n\n**效果上限**：被换的人和角色发型长短、体型、性别接近时最好；差很多时不完美，但能用。人走出画面再回来可能被当成新的人（看 info 里的提醒）。\n\n---\n\n**What it does**: one run redraws the recast people at a few moments (keyframes), writes the Remake plan and packs a plan zip. Then open `H3MD Director Remake.json`, Import plan → the zip, run.\n\n**Steps**: drag the source video into the \"Source video\" (Load Video) node, optional `start_s` / `end_s` to recast only that part (cut with its sound); character pictures on picture_1…5; `mapping` like \"picture 1 -> left 2\" (people numbered **left to right in the first clear frame**: check the people sheet); one description line per picture (race, age, face, hair, every garment); run; check the keyframe sheet.\n\n**Any image-edit model works in the middle**: crops = image 1, pictures = image 2, prompts = prompt, its output → Assemble `edited`. The prompt enhancer can be bypassed.\n\n**Models (this example)**: Qwen Image 2.1 int8 / text encoder / VAE from [Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1); 2-step LoRA [linoyts/Qwen-Image-2.1-DMD2-2steps](https://huggingface.co/linoyts/Qwen-Image-2.1-DMD2-2steps) (sigmas 1.0, 0.5, 0; shift 1; cfg 1); prompt enhancer nodes [ComfyUI-Prompt-Enhancer](https://github.com/xiaowuapple-pixel/ComfyUI-Prompt-Enhancer) with the PE GGUF models ([T2I](https://huggingface.co/prithivMLmods/Qwen-Image-2.1-PE-T2I-GGUF), [I2I + mmproj](https://huggingface.co/prithivMLmods/Qwen-Image-2.1-PE-I2I-GGUF)); people tracking: ComfyUI core SAM3.1 `sam3.1_multiplex_fp16.safetensors` in models/checkpoints.\n"
   ],
   "title": "Note: 怎么用 How to use"
  },
